# Gtk3::SourceEditor

A **Vim-style** source code editor widget built on
*Gtk3::SourceView*.

## Features

- Vim-style keybindings (normal, insert, visual modes)
- Syntax highlighting for 20+ languages
- Light and dark themes
- Undo/redo support
- Line numbers gutter

## Installation

```bash
cpanm Gtk3::SourceEditor
```

### From source

```bash
perl Makefile.PL
make
make test
make install
```

## Quick Start

```perl
use Gtk3 -init;
use Gtk3::SourceEditor;

my $editor = Gtk3::SourceEditor->new();
$editor->set_language('perl');
$editor->set_theme('dark');
$editor->set_text('# hello world');
```

## Configuration

| Setting     | Default   | Description              |
|-------------|-----------|--------------------------|
| `vim_mode`  | `1`       | Enable vim keybindings   |
| `theme`     | `light`   | Color theme to use       |
| `tab_width` | `4`       | Tab stop width in spaces |

